  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電磁學(二)",
    "sub_ename": "ELECTROMAGNETICS(2)",
    "describe_ch": "隨著無線通信及高速數位電路技術與應用的發展，舉凡電路、天線、以及信號傳輸等都必須仰賴電磁原理，學生應對相關領域的技術能力與要求具有基本的了解能力，本課程將延續電磁學(一)中所介紹的傳輸線於無線通信系統各方面所扮演的角色，然後從傳輸線理論中的電容與電感特性開始，逐步導入完整的靜電學與靜磁學理論，進而推展到動態時便場電磁波的傳播應用。",
    "describe_eh": "Since technologies and applications of wireless communications and high-speed digital circuit are booming, the circuits, antennas and signal transmissions all depend on electromagnetic principles. The students should respond to the demand with technical capability from the field. This course begins with an introduction describing the role that transmission line has in various aspects of wireless communications system. Illustrating the characteristics of capacitance and inductance in transmission line, we then introduce the complete static electrostatics and magnetoststics theory. Finally, we will develop the propagation concept of electromagnetic waves with dynamic time-varying fields.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能用自己的詞彙定義何謂靜電學與靜磁學：能夠描述重要的靜電學與靜磁學特性；能夠描述影響靜電學與靜磁學的重要影響因素",
      "describe_en": "Define electrostatics and magnetoststics with their own words: Be able to describe electrostatics and magnetoststics and their characteristics; be able to describe important factors impacting electrostatics and magnetoststics. Understand and be able to ex"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能辨識出可應用電磁學的場合，並能清楚表達，能使用相關原理",
      "describe_en": "Be able to use related principles to plan an evaluation about measuring electromagnetics' capability and limitation, and draw appropriate conclusions from analysis. Use principles of electromagnetics to evaluate a product or system and propose a feasible"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "知道於何處可找到電磁學的相關資訊、研究結果及標準，並可評估所獲資訊的適用性",
      "describe_en": "Know where to locate and access related electromagnetics information, research, as well as standards, and be able to evaluate the appropriateness of the obtained information."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "能針對一特定有關電磁學的議題或情境，設計一合理模擬，加以驗證，並適切歸納出結論",
      "describe_en": "Design a reasonable simulation for a specific electromagnetics issue or scenario, conduct the simulation, and draw appropriate conclusions. Communicate results in written or oral form to classmates, teaching assistants, and the instructor."
    }
  ],
